7	/**
8	 * Inbound bounce / complaint webhook SEAM (Phase 2).
9	 *
10	 * This is the single choke point a real feedback source wires into later — SES
11	 * SNS notifications (Bounce/Complaint) or a Mailcow FBL forwarder. No live IMAP
12	 * polling this phase; the plumbing (suppression + circuit breaker) is done and
